  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For acceleration to be zero, the net force should be zero.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>mgsin&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;mgcos&#952;</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>",
